  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xF6;ttar Research Africa i sitt arbete f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka den afrikanska forskarv&#xE4;rlden genom att tillhandah&#xE5;lla en best&#xE5;ende online-system f&#xF6;r finansieringsm&#xF6;jligheter och forskningsrelaterade nyheter</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida supports Research Africa in its work to strengthen the African research community by providing a comprising online system of funding opportunities and research related news. Sida&apos;s cooperation with Research Africa aims in strengthening the connection between African policymakers and researchers with the global research community.</narrative>
  </description>
